Your entity, has the `end_date` marked as invalid, which is why the data has not been added to the entity. Oddly, the following test case passes:

``` php
$date = ['year' => 2015, 'month' => 9, 'day' => 21, 'hour' => 12, 'minute' => 30, 'meridian' => 'pm'];
$this->assertTrue(Validation::datetime($date));
```

Are there any other validation rules on the end_date?
